            <note corresp="#d82-f2" n="4" xml:id="d82-f2-content">
                <p>If a zero area ABM is agreed to, then the
                    Minuteman or Bomber defense would have to be a system other than Safeguard.
                    [Footnote is in the original.]</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d82-f3" n="5" xml:id="d82-f3-content">
